      "seconds": 24.09,
      "text": "Nineteen ninety nine. Simons and Chabris filmed students passing a basketball and asked viewers to count the passes. Midway through, a person in a gorilla suit walks into frame, stops, beats their chest, and strolls out. It takes nine seconds. About half of all viewers never see it. Not glance past it. Never register that it happened.",
